{"unit_id":"enterhalf__dsh-web-network-optimizer#feature-1","repo":"enterhalf/dsh-web-network-optimizer","commit":"c735a1368eda845fb6754916d2b712027c54c2d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-network-optimizer 的功能「响应压缩」：包装网页服务器的响应处理器，在客户端支持时对可压缩内容使用 brotli 或 gzip。请求经过已注册路由时自动触发，压缩后响应并计入流量账本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:56-71","src/index.js:763-780"]}
